{"title":"신형빈 액션정벌 컬렉션","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=rYLka/hAM59miMfc/ANZKkb1RDHDzOgVpQS2OI0&filename=th3","synopsis":"전쟁은 이미 시작되었다! <도시정벌 6부> 신개정판 카카오 상륙!\n\n※<도시정벌 6부 신개정판> 이용 안내입니다.\n-원작인 성인판 <도시정벌 6부>를 일반 연령가의 기준에 맞춰 내용을 수정한 신개정판입니다.\n-검수 기준에 따라 일부 수정되거나 잘리는 장면이 있을 수 있습니다.\n-표지가 바뀌었으며 새로운 데이터로 작업되었지만, 내용은 기존의 <도시정벌 6부 [개정판]>과 같사오니 중복 이용에 주의 부탁 드립니다.\n\n■수록작품\n1. 도시유혼 1,2부(개정판)\n2. 살수도시(개정판)\n3. 도시정벌 6부(신개정판)","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":43,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":37,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":37,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":46,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":34,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":55,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":25,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":37,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":101}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":150,"change":{"type":"down","amount":88}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":94}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":43,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":48,"change":{"type":"up","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":51,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":48,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":153,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":84,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":59,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"202